// Plain-scope entry points for the conditional-decode set above, mirroring
// the existing thin experimental::X forwarding wrappers but pointed at
// experimental::conditional::X instead, so this decode variant is directly
// callable (tomos::cuda::conditional::X(...)) for A/B comparison against the
// default branchless decode used by the unqualified names above.
